OL,3,GNEWSAWhy AI could replace 22 jobs in
OL,4,Acouncil social care
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn AI tool could be used to help
OL,7,Freplace more than 20 jobs that are
OL,8,Fbeing axed at Worcestershire County
OL,9,FCouncil - with bosses warning that
OL,10,Fdeeper staff reductions are on the way.
OL,12,FThe authority is consulting over
OL,13,Fcutting 22 full-time equivalent roles
OL,14,Fin children's and adult social care,
OL,15,Fwith artificial intelligence being
OL,16,Frelied on to pick up the administrative
OL,17,Fworkload.
OL,19,FThe move has been criticised by the
OL,20,Funion, Unison, which said it was
OL,21,F"deeply concerned" about "automation"
OL,22,Freplacing humans.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
