OL,3,GNEWSAWhy AI could replace 22 jobs in
OL,4,Acouncil social care
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Adam Kent, the deputy
OL,7,Fleader, said: "This isn't a way of
OL,8,Fremoving staff; it's a way of
OL,9,Ftransforming services - it massively
OL,10,Fimproves productivity and accuracy."
